### Bench Experiment: Light vs Shadow

When wiring your LDR circuit:
1. Connect one leg of the LDR to +5V.
2. Connect the other leg to analog pin **A0**, AND connect a 10kΩ resistor from that same A0 junction to **GND**.

```cpp
void setup() {
  Serial.begin(9600);
}

void loop() {
  int lightLevel = analogRead(A0);
  Serial.print("Raw Light Level (0-1023): ");
  Serial.println(lightLevel);
  delay(100);
}
```

**Laboratory Task:**
Observe the live readings in the simulator. Cover the sensor with your thumb to observe darkness drop, then shine a light to observe the voltage rise!
